---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import BlogJsonLd from "../../components/BlogJsonLd.astro";
const post = {
  slug: "ai-tools-daily-2026-07-11",
  title_en: "AI Tools Daily Roundup — July 11, 2026",
  desc_en: "Today: Claude adds MCP marketplace, Midjourney v7 alpha leaks, n8n releases AI agent nodes, and 5 new tools launched.",
  date: "2026-07-11",
  tags: ["daily", "news", "roundup"]
};
const siteUrl = "https://thebestaitoolsreview.com";
---
<BaseLayout title={post.title_en} description={post.desc_en} keywords={post.tags.join(", ")}>
  <BlogJsonLd post={post} />
  <div class="article" style="max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 0;">
    <nav class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> &rsaquo; <a href="/blog/">Blog</a> &rsaquo; <span>Daily Roundup</span></nav>
    <header class="article-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">Daily Roundup</span>
      <h1>{post.title_en}</h1>
      <p style="color:var(--text-mute);font-size:14px;margin-top:4px;">{post.date}</p>
    </header>
      <img src="/images/blog/ai-tools-daily-2026-07-11/hero.jpg" alt="ai tools daily 2026 07 11" style="width:100%;border-radius:12px;margin:24px 0;" loading="eager" />
    <section class="article-body">
      <h2>Major Updates</h2>
      <img src="/images/blog/ai-tools-daily-2026-07-11/inline-1.jpg" alt="Major Updates" style="width:100%;border-radius:12px;margin:20px 0;" loading="lazy" />
      <h3>Claude Adds MCP Marketplace</h3>
      <p>Anthropic announced a <strong>Model Context Protocol (MCP) marketplace</strong> within Claude Desktop, allowing users to browse and install MCP servers directly. This eliminates the manual JSON configuration that was a barrier to entry. Initial marketplace includes 50+ servers for GitHub, Slack, Notion, Google Drive, and more. <a href="/tool/claude/">Learn more about Claude</a>.</p>

      <h3>Midjourney v7 Alpha Leaks</h3>
      <p>Midjourney v7 alpha images surfaced on Discord, showing significantly improved photorealism, better hand rendering, and native 4K output. Key improvements include: reduced prompt dependency (simpler prompts produce better results), improved skin texture, and faster generation (~15 seconds vs 60 seconds for v6). <a href="/tool/midjourney/">See our Midjourney review</a>.</p>

      <h3>n8n Releases AI Agent Nodes</h3>
      <p>n8n shipped native <strong>AI Agent nodes</strong> with built-in tool-calling, memory, and multi-step reasoning. The new nodes support OpenAI, Anthropic, and local models via Ollama. This positions n8n as a serious alternative to LangGraph for visual agent building. <a href="/tool/n8n/">Explore n8n workflows</a>.</p>

      <h2>New Tool Launches</h2>
      <img src="/images/blog/ai-tools-daily-2026-07-11/inline-2.jpg" alt="New Tool Launches" style="width:100%;border-radius:12px;margin:20px 0;" loading="lazy" />
      <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
        <li><strong>PromptBase 2.0</strong> — Marketplace for selling AI prompts with revenue sharing</li>
        <li><strong>CodeSandbox AI</strong> — In-browser AI coding agent with live preview</li>
        <li><strong>Veed AI Subtitles</strong> — Real-time AI subtitle generation in 100+ languages</li>
        <li><strong>Reflect AI Notes</strong> — AI note-taking with automatic linking and summaries</li>
        <li><strong>Polish AI Photos</strong> — One-click product photo enhancer for e-commerce</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Pricing Changes</h2>
      <img src="/images/blog/ai-tools-daily-2026-07-11/inline-3.jpg" alt="Pricing Changes" style="width:100%;border-radius:12px;margin:20px 0;" loading="lazy" />
      <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
        <li><strong>Cursor</strong>: Pro plan now $20/mo (was $15), adds unlimited AI requests</li>
        <li><strong>Suno</strong>: Free tier now includes 10 songs/day (was 5)</li>
        <li><strong>Dify</strong>: New Team plan at $59/mo with 5 seats included</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Workflow of the Day</h2>
      <p>Looking to automate your email triage? Check out our <a href="/workflows/n8n-email-triage-agent/">AI Email Triage workflow with n8n</a> — it classifies incoming emails, drafts responses, and escalates urgent items automatically.</p>

      <div style="background:var(--card-bg);border:1px solid var(--border-color);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;margin:24px 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;">This Page Answers</h3>
        <ul style="margin:0;padding-left:20px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text-soft);line-height:1.8;">
          <li>What AI tools launched on July 11, 2026?</li>
          <li>What are the latest AI tool updates and pricing changes?</li>
          <li>What is new with Claude MCP, Midjourney v7, and n8n AI agents?</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <p style="text-align:center;margin-top:24px;"><a href="/newsletter/" style="color:var(--accent-color);font-weight:600;">Subscribe for daily updates</a></p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
